#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:5
#: e096c8619a8c4d78a3a7826e6eb5debf
msgid "Traditional Helicopter Tips"
msgstr "传统直升机技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:7
#: 6c2d748f1b9748999741e0629617700f
msgid "Be sure to follow the wiki instructions, step by step!"
msgstr "务必逐步按照 wiki 说明操作！"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:8
#: a0e84d057958405f8f496a64cbefa361
msgid "Be sure the CG is in line with the main rotor shaft"
msgstr "确保重心与主旋翼轴对齐"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:9
#: a9e585cb6ae744bf8d1431863d2d63ff
msgid ""
"Blade tracking must be within a quarter blade thickness or better to avoid "
"excessive vibration"
msgstr "桨叶跟踪必须在四分之一桨叶厚度以内或更好，以避免过大的震动"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:11
#: 787fef1afa674b32a7bfcbfae7755f70
msgid "Vibration is the arch enemy of Helicopter autopilots!"
msgstr "震动是直升机飞控的头号大敌！"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:11
#: 9dcb4d51354b4b949e334b7488f79d37
msgid ""
"Internal Combustion Engines and Turbines can created high frequency "
"vibrations that do not appear in the VIBE logs and can be aliased to low "
"frequencies which can impact EKF and Attitude control (see below for ground "
"tests to check for this). This also often occurs in electric helicopters."
msgstr ""
"内燃机和涡轮发动机可能产生高频震动，这些震动不会出现在 VIBE 日志中，可能被混叠到低频，从而影响 EKF "
"和姿态控制（详见下方地面测试检查方法）。这种情况在电动直升机中也常见。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:12
#: 7021cd77a9d14686825b33f5337da5e1
msgid ""
"The autopilot should be well isolated for vibration. Using autopilots with "
"internal IMU vibration damping and vibration reducing mounts is recommended."
msgstr "飞控应有良好的隔震措施。建议使用具有内部 IMU 减震和减震安装座的飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:13
#: cf84f8ac7c5345b388c25ac30744f48b
msgid ""
"Traditional Helicopter *is* capable of inverted flight and using full "
"negative collective ranges."
msgstr "传统直升机 *能够* 倒飞并使用完全负总距范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:16
#: f9fe96453601431c8d9bc1a21ae2a289
msgid "Checking for High Frequency Vibration"
msgstr "检查高频震动"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:18
#: 4c5f651ec5c94bcf963ca79d47b99fac
msgid ""
"High frequency vibrations in this context are vibrations close to the IMU "
"sampling frequency, or its multiples, which will be aliased down into the "
"same range as control inputs for the attitude controllers. Symptoms of high "
"frequency vibration can be that the attitude estimate becomes incorrect "
"causing it to lean significantly even though the pilot is commanding level "
"flight in stabilized modes. In the extreme, it can result in an :ref:`ekf-"
"inav-failsafe` or even a crash. Excessive vibration can also make altitude "
"hold imprecise or even produce uncontrollable climbs/descents."
msgstr ""
"此处所述的高频震动是指接近 IMU "
"采样频率或其倍数的震动，这些震动将被混叠到与姿态控制器控制输入相同的频率范围。高频震动的症状可能是姿态估计变得不准确，导致飞行器明显倾斜，即使飞手在稳定模式下命令水平飞行。在极端情况下，可能导致"
" :ref:`ekf-inav-failsafe` 甚至坠毁。过大的震动还可能使高度保持不精确，甚至产生无法控制的爬升/下降。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:20
#: e158b35b5e8a4c52a4962eb66a561033
msgid ""
"One method of testing this, is to secure the helicopter to the ground, and "
"run up the main rotor, watching the artificial horizon in the ground control"
" station. If it moves away from level, you probably have a vibration issue "
"which needs to be addressed. Testing should be done at various collective "
"levels and rotor speeds. Be careful not to over-stress the helicopter with "
"collective extremes."
msgstr ""
"测试此问题的一种方法是将直升机固定在地面上，启动主旋翼，观察地面控制站中的人工地平线。如果它偏离水平，您可能有震动问题需要解决。测试应在不同的总距和旋翼转速下进行。注意不要通过极端总距对直升机施加过度应力。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:22
#: 368224e36e81452380c80671fae216af
msgid "Setup for ground test:"
msgstr "地面测试设置："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:24
#: 43173683966442fcb246cdc5ba1be8e7
msgid "Secure vehicle to the ground."
msgstr "将飞行器固定在地面上。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:25
#: 216a42ea777a41dcb16205b69c3ec11e
msgid ""
"Temporarily reduce Roll, Pitch, and Yaw  P,I,and D, PIDs to zero. Be sure to"
" restore them after this test!"
msgstr "临时将横滚、俯仰和偏航的 P、I、D PID 值降为零。务必在测试后恢复！"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:26
#: bf66c033d014477cb0c2043d94b35558
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`ACRO_OPTIONS<ACRO_OPTIONS>` = 2, temporarily, if not being used "
"already."
msgstr "如果尚未使用，临时将 :ref:`ACRO_OPTIONS<ACRO_OPTIONS>` = 2。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:27
#: 067da62979454ee98acfd0c36d89c9cf
msgid "Change to ACRO mode."
msgstr "切换到 Acro 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:28
#: f8741a1a9d07460e832d5dba5fa59731
msgid ""
"Arm and engage motor interlock, allowing the vehicle to spool up at 0 degree"
" pitch, watching for any change from level in the GSC of the artificial "
"horizon. Any significant tilt indicates noise is disrupting the attitude "
"estimate and should be investigated and eliminated."
msgstr ""
"解锁并接合电机联锁，允许飞行器在 0 度螺距下加速，观察地面控制站人工地平线是否偏离水平。任何明显倾斜均表明噪声正在干扰姿态估计，应进行调查和消除。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:29
#: 39ebc031d35040af896b575f3f45314f
msgid ""
"Change the target main rotor speed a bit above and below the nominal target "
"using the :ref:`H_RSC_SETPOINT<H_RSC_SETPOINT>` (or TX throttle curve if "
"using Passthru mode) and repeat."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`H_RSC_SETPOINT<H_RSC_SETPOINT>` "
"（或如果使用直通模式则使用发射机油门曲线）将目标主旋翼转速在标称目标值上下变动一些并重复测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:30
#: 85e7ac08e00d4fef8dabd68317914245
msgid "Re-check the blade tracking also while doing this test."
msgstr "在进行此测试时，同时重新检查桨叶跟踪情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:32
#: 904b9aae279f4d62904187d9e7e4260a
msgid ""
"Be sure to also eliminate the possibility of lower frequency vibrations from"
" the main or tail rotors causing the issue. Unlike vibrations near the "
"sampling rate and its harmonics, which cannot be eliminated by software "
"filtering, rotor vibrations can be improved using ArduPilot's notch "
"filtering feature. See :ref:`common-measuring-vibration` and "
":ref:`Helicopter Dynamic Notch Filter Setup<common-imu-notch-filtering-"
"helicopter-setup>`."
msgstr ""
"务必也排除来自主旋翼或尾旋翼的较低频率震动导致问题的可能性。与接近采样率及其谐波的震动（无法通过软件滤波消除）不同，旋翼震动可以使用 ArduPilot"
" 的陷波滤波功能改善。请参见 :ref:`common-measuring-vibration` 和 "
":ref:`直升机动态陷波滤波器设置<common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:35
#: 51379c5d52f14e9999ca5a7fc8ca8e71
msgid "Possible False Landing Detections"
msgstr "可能的错误降落检测"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tips.rst:37
#: 31867dd3064640f58a5e8200c9c61260
msgid ""
"Under extreme circumstances (flying in extremely turbulent conditions, for "
"example), it is possible for the firmware, to falsely detect a landing "
"condition, although still flying. This can lead to lack of control in "
"position control modes and even possible disarming. An RC Auxiliary Function"
" (\"159\") is provided to allow an RC to enable (needed when actually "
"landing) or disable (to prevent false detects during missions) the landing "
"detection algorithm under pilot control."
msgstr ""
"在极端情况下（例如在极端湍流条件下飞行），固件可能错误地检测到降落条件，尽管仍在飞行中。这可能导致在位置控制模式下失去控制，甚至可能上锁。提供了 RC "
"辅助功能（\"159\"），允许遥控启用（实际降落时需要）或禁用（防止在任务期间错误检测）飞手控制下的降落检测算法。"
